{"data":{"current_mention_tongjian_id":"8bfa320d-db0e-11ef-908b-a0d3651f611f","current_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8bf8ca66-db0e-11ef-8b87-a0d3651f611f","occurrence_page":{"anchor_paragraph_order":0,"current_page":1,"items":[{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"絳州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"丘","people_name_jianti_auto":"丘","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"b4548b46-db0e-11ef-8f7a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"左丘明","people_name_jianti_auto":"左丘明","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"b4548b47-db0e-11ef-8eef-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"太公","people_name_jianti_auto":"太公","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"b4548b48-db0e-11ef-b839-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"獻帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"献帝","start_index":56,"tongjian_id":"b4548b49-db0e-11ef-8dbc-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"丘敦氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"丘敦氏","start_index":60,"tongjian_id":"b4548b4a-db0e-11ef-8501-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"丘氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"丘氏","start_index":67,"tongjian_id":"b4548b4b-db0e-11ef-9343-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"丘和","people_name_jianti_auto":"丘和","start_index":107,"tongjian_id":"b4548b4c-db0e-11ef-bd56-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"丘敦氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"丘敦氏","start_index":116,"tongjian_id":"b4548b4d-db0e-11ef-be78-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"隋","place_name_jianti_auto":"隋","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b4548b4e-db0e-11ef-b7e7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"營丘","place_name_jianti_auto":"营丘","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"b4548b4f-db0e-11ef-bcbf-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"后魏","start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"b4548b50-db0e-11ef-86d7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"拓跋","place_name_jianti_auto":"拓跋","start_index":71,"tongjian_id":"b4548b51-db0e-11ef-b596-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"洛陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"洛阳","start_index":75,"tongjian_id":"b4548b52-db0e-11ef-837e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河南","place_name_jianti_auto":"河南","start_index":101,"tongjian_id":"b4548b53-db0e-11ef-856a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"洛陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"洛阳","start_index":103,"tongjian_id":"b4548b54-db0e-11ef-a78c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"洛陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"洛阳","start_index":110,"tongjian_id":"b4548b55-db0e-11ef-8391-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"隋制，左右武衞將軍，領外軍宿衞。風俗通：丘姓，左丘明之後。又云：太公封於營丘，支孫以地爲氏。又魏書·官氏志：後魏獻帝次弟丘敦氏，後改爲丘氏。按拓跋南都洛陽，凡北人從之南遷者，三字姓、複姓皆改從單字姓，爲河南洛陽人。丘和旣洛陽人，蓋卽丘敦氏之後。","note_content_jianti_auto":"隋制，左右武衞将军，领外军宿衞。风俗通：丘姓，左丘明之后。又云：太公封于营丘，支孙以地为氏。又魏书·官氏志：后魏献帝次弟丘敦氏，后改为丘氏。按拓跋南都洛阳，凡北人从之南迁者，三字姓、复姓皆改从单字姓，为河南洛阳人。丘和既洛阳人，盖即丘敦氏之后。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"b4548b45-db0e-11ef-a922-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"武后","people_name_jianti_auto":"武后","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"b4548b59-db0e-11ef-90bd-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"中宗","people_name_jianti_auto":"中宗","start_index":48,"tongjian_id":"b4548b5a-db0e-11ef-b33e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"隋","place_name_jianti_auto":"隋","start_index":63,"tongjian_id":"b4548b5b-db0e-11ef-91c7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"羃，莫狄翻。䍦，音離。新唐志曰：婦人施羃䍦以蔽身。永徽中，始用帷冒，施帬及頸。武后時，帷冒益盛。中宗後，無復羃䍦矣。按帷冒起於隋。騎，奇寄翻；下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"羃，莫狄翻。䍠，音离。新唐志曰：妇人施羃䍠以蔽身。永徽中，始用帷冒，施帬及颈。武后时，帷冒益盛。中宗后，无复羃䍠矣。按帷冒起于隋。骑，奇寄翻；下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"b4548b58-db0e-11ef-9c2e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"蒲州","place_name_jianti_auto":"蒲州","place_note":"山西省永济市","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"b4548b5e-db0e-11ef-88eb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"門司，蒲州之掌城門者。","note_content_jianti_auto":"门司，蒲州之掌城门者。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":51,"tongjian_id":"b4548b5d-db0e-11ef-a46d-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"榮","people_name_jianti_auto":"荣","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"b4548b60-db0e-11ef-b191-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"周榮公","people_name_jianti_auto":"周荣公","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"b4548b61-db0e-11ef-95e6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"勃海郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"勃海郡","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b4548b62-db0e-11ef-a03d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"棣州","place_name_jianti_auto":"棣州","place_note":"山东省阳信县","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"b4548b63-db0e-11ef-9e41-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"滄州","place_name_jianti_auto":"沧州","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"b4548b64-db0e-11ef-9314-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"北平郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"北平郡","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"b4548b65-db0e-11ef-813f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"平州","place_name_jianti_auto":"平州","place_note":"河北省卢龙县","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"b4548b66-db0e-11ef-9793-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"勃海郡，開皇六年置棣州。大業二年改滄州。北平郡，舊置平州。榮姓，周榮公之後。","note_content_jianti_auto":"勃海郡，开皇六年置棣州。大业二年改沧州。北平郡，旧置平州。荣姓，周荣公之后。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":91,"tongjian_id":"b4548b5f-db0e-11ef-b8a3-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"諒","people_name_jianti_auto":"谅","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"b4548b68-db0e-11ef-98f0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"蒲津","place_name_jianti_auto":"蒲津","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"b4548b69-db0e-11ef-9af0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河","place_name_jianti_auto":"河","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"b4548b6a-db0e-11ef-8610-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"b4548b6b-db0e-11ef-ba62-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"此蒲津之橋也，諒欲斷河，謂可坐有舊齊之地耳。斷，音丁管翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"此蒲津之桥也，谅欲断河，谓可坐有旧齐之地耳。断，音丁管翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":127,"tongjian_id":"b4548b67-db0e-11ef-9784-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"臨汾郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"临汾郡","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"b4548b6d-db0e-11ef-9eb8-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉州","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋州","place_note":"山西临汾市","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"b4548b6e-db0e-11ef-94c9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"絳郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"绛郡","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"b4548b6f-db0e-11ef-9b4b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"后魏","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"b4548b70-db0e-11ef-b0d1-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"東雍州","place_name_jianti_auto":"东雍州","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"b4548b71-db0e-11ef-8c59-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後周","place_name_jianti_auto":"后周","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"b4548b72-db0e-11ef-95b5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"絳州","place_name_jianti_auto":"绛州","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"b4548b73-db0e-11ef-8cae-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"上黨郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"上党郡","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"b4548b74-db0e-11ef-993f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後周","place_name_jianti_auto":"后周","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"b4548b75-db0e-11ef-a54f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"潞州","place_name_jianti_auto":"潞州","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"b4548b76-db0e-11ef-b6ce-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"上黨郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"上党郡","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"b4548b77-db0e-11ef-aa15-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"襄垣縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"襄垣县","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"b4548b78-db0e-11ef-858e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後周","place_name_jianti_auto":"后周","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"b4548b79-db0e-11ef-a488-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"韓州","place_name_jianti_auto":"韩州","start_index":46,"tongjian_id":"b4548b7a-db0e-11ef-957d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"長平郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"长平郡","start_index":56,"tongjian_id":"b4548b7b-db0e-11ef-b595-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"建州","place_name_jianti_auto":"建州","start_index":62,"tongjian_id":"b4548b7c-db0e-11ef-bc1f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"澤州","place_name_jianti_auto":"泽州","start_index":70,"tongjian_id":"b4548b7d-db0e-11ef-a7bb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"隋志：臨汾郡，晉州。絳郡，後魏置東雍州，後周改絳州。上黨郡，後周置潞州。上黨郡襄垣縣，後周置韓州，大業初，州廢。長平郡，舊曰建州，開皇初，改澤州。菩，蒲乎翻。薩，桑葛翻。耼，他甘翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"隋志：临汾郡，晋州。绛郡，后魏置东雍州，后周改绛州。上党郡，后周置潞州。上党郡襄垣县，后周置韩州，大业初，州废。长平郡，旧曰建州，开皇初，改泽州。菩，蒲乎翻。萨，桑葛翻。耼，他甘翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":232,"tongjian_id":"b4548b6c-db0e-11ef-9231-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"復，扶又翻。帥，讀曰率；下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"复，扶又翻。帅，读曰率；下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":273,"tongjian_id":"b4548b80-db0e-11ef-a30a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"司法，卽法曹行參軍。","note_content_jianti_auto":"司法，即法曹行参军。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":327,"tongjian_id":"b4548b81-db0e-11ef-9441-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"b4548b44-db0e-11ef-8869-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"mì","source_anchor_text":"數百騎戴羃䍦詐稱諒","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":29,"text":"羃","tongjian_id":"dfa41975-2008-5c56-b640-dbf45d33cbd0"},{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"b4548b44-db0e-11ef-8869-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"lí","source_anchor_text":"百騎戴羃䍦詐稱諒宮","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":30,"text":"䍦","tongjian_id":"45407678-b4fe-50ee-9ffb-d179a7851fd9"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"絳州","place_name_jianti_auto":"绛州","resolved_place_entity_id":776,"start_index":200,"tongjian_id":"b4569a9c-db0e-11ef-ac8a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/〇、封域山川险要（卷三十九）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"大业十三年，李渊引兵自河东济河而西，朝邑法曹靳孝谟以蒲津...","context_before":"...皇中，诸州调物，每岁河南自潼关，河北自蒲坂，输于长安]。","source_end_index":1059,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8c54d552-e93f-572b-bfac-fd23d44666a3","source_start_index":957,"source_text":"仁寿末，汉王谅谋举兵并州，裴文安说谅曰：今率精锐，直入蒲津，以大军继后，风行电击，顿于霸上[见陕西长安县]，咸阳以东，指挥可定，京师震扰，谁敢不从。谅不能用，而遣将断河桥，守蒲州，杨素衔枚潜济，谅军遂败。"}],"path":"山西方舆纪要/〇、封域山川险要（卷三十九）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、太原府（卷四十）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"大业十三年，李渊以晋阳举义，兵遂下汾、晋，取关中。唐武德...","context_before":"...指太原，倾其巢穴，便可一举而定。周主用其策，而高齐果覆。","source_end_index":507,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"192e46c4-d698-5aa2-af71-576441d161eb","source_start_index":397,"source_text":"隋仁寿末，汉王谅起兵晋阳，遣其党余公理出大谷、趣河阳[见河南重险]，綦良出滏口。[见河南磁州]，趣黎阳[见直隶濬县]，刘建出井陉[见直隶重险]、略燕赵，乔钟葵出雁门、略代北，又遣裴文安等入蒲津，径指长安，寻为杨素所破败。"}],"path":"山西方舆纪要/一、太原府（卷四十）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"帝以右武衞將軍洛陽丘和爲蒲州刺史，鎭蒲津。諒選精銳數百騎戴羃䍦，詐稱諒宮人還長安，門司弗覺，徑入蒲州，城中豪傑亦有應之者；丘和覺其變，踰城，逃歸長安。蒲州長史勃海高義明、司馬北平榮毗皆爲反者所執。裴文安等未至蒲津百餘里，諒忽改圖，令紇單貴斷河橋，守蒲州，而召文安還。文安至，謂諒曰：「兵機詭速，本欲出其不意。王旣不行，文安又返，使彼計成，大事去矣。」諒不對。以王耼爲蒲州刺史，裴文安爲晉州刺史，薛粹爲絳州刺史，梁菩薩爲潞州刺史，韋道正爲韓州刺史，張伯英爲澤州刺史。代州總管天水李景發兵拒諒，諒遣其將劉暠襲景；景擊斬之。諒復遣喬鍾葵帥勁勇三萬攻之，景戰士不過數千，加以城池不固，爲鍾葵所攻，崩毀相繼，景且戰且築，士卒皆殊死鬬；鍾葵屢敗。司馬馮孝慈、司法呂玉並驍勇善戰，儀同三司侯莫陳乂多謀畫，工拒守之術，景知三人可用，推誠任之，己無所關預，唯在閤持重，時撫循而已。","content_fanyi":"隋炀帝任命右武卫将军、洛阳人丘和为蒲州刺史，镇守蒲津。杨谅挑选数百名精锐骑兵，戴着妇女遮面的羃䍦，诈称是杨谅的宫人要返回长安，守门卫士没有察觉，径直进入蒲州，城中也有豪侠亡命之徒响应；丘和发觉情况异常，翻越城墙逃回长安。蒲州长史勃海人高义明、司马北平人荣毗都被反叛者抓获。裴文安等人距离蒲津关还有一百多里时，杨谅忽然改变计划，命令纥单贵拆断河桥，据守蒲州，并召回裴文安。裴文安回来后，对杨谅说：“用兵的关键在于诡诈而神速，原本是想趁对方不备。大王既然没有亲自前行，文安又被召回，让对方的计谋得以成功，大事就无法挽回了。”杨谅没有回答。杨谅任命王聃为蒲州刺史，裴文安为晋州刺史，薛粹为绛州刺史，梁菩萨为潞州刺史，韦道正为韩州刺史，张伯英为泽州刺史。代州总管天水人李景发兵抵抗杨谅，杨谅派部将刘暠袭击李景；李景迎击并斩杀刘暠。杨谅又派乔钟葵率领三万精兵进攻李景，李景手下战士不过数千人，加上城池并不坚固，遭到乔钟葵进攻后城墙接连崩毁，李景一边作战一边修筑，士兵都拼死搏斗；乔钟葵屡次被击退。代州司马冯孝慈、司法吕玉都骁勇善战，仪同三司侯莫陈乂足智多谋，擅长防御固守之术，李景知道这三人可以重用，便诚心任用他们，自己不加以干预，只在衙署内坐镇主持大计，时常抚慰巡视而已。","content_jianti_auto":"帝以右武衞将军洛阳丘和为蒲州刺史，镇蒲津。谅选精锐数百骑戴羃䍠，诈称谅宫人还长安，门司弗觉，径入蒲州，城中豪杰亦有应之者；丘和觉其变，逾城，逃归长安。蒲州长史勃海高义明、司马北平荣毗皆为反者所执。裴文安等未至蒲津百余里，谅忽改图，令纥单贵断河桥，守蒲州，而召文安还。文安至，谓谅曰：「兵机诡速，本欲出其不意。王既不行，文安又返，使彼计成，大事去矣。」谅不对。以王耼为蒲州刺史，裴文安为晋州刺史，薛粹为绛州刺史，梁菩萨为潞州刺史，韦道正为韩州刺史，张伯英为泽州刺史。代州总管天水李景发兵拒谅，谅遣其将刘暠袭景；景击斩之。谅复遣乔钟葵帅劲勇三万攻之，景战士不过数千，加以城池不固，为钟葵所攻，崩毁相继，景且战且筑，士卒皆殊死鬬；钟葵屡败。司马冯孝慈、司法吕玉并骁勇善战，仪同三司侯莫陈乂多谋画，工拒守之术，景知三人可用，推诚任之，己无所关预，唯在合持重，时抚循而已。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":17435,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百八十 (隋紀四) / 高祖文皇帝下 / 仁壽四年 / 第 15 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"b4548b44-db0e-11ef-8869-a0d3651f611f","year_int":604},"tongjian_id":"b4548b44-db0e-11ef-8869-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"絳州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"宋白","people_name_jianti_auto":"宋白","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b6c844d5-db0e-11ef-98fe-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"絳州","place_name_jianti_auto":"绛州","place_note":"山西省新绛县","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"b6c844d6-db0e-11ef-925c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"b6c844d7-db0e-11ef-8c81-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"新田","place_name_jianti_auto":"新田","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"b6c844d8-db0e-11ef-a8ad-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後周","place_name_jianti_auto":"后周","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"b6c844d9-db0e-11ef-ae11-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"絳州","place_name_jianti_auto":"绛州","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"b6c844da-db0e-11ef-b0fe-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"龍門","place_name_jianti_auto":"龙门","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"b6c844db-db0e-11ef-8c16-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"b6c844dc-db0e-11ef-8eee-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"皮氏縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"皮氏县","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"b6c844dd-db0e-11ef-a644-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"后魏","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"b6c844de-db0e-11ef-85b7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"龍門縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"龙门县","start_index":42,"tongjian_id":"b6c844df-db0e-11ef-956a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"隋","place_name_jianti_auto":"隋","start_index":46,"tongjian_id":"b6c844e0-db0e-11ef-84ef-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":48,"tongjian_id":"b6c844e1-db0e-11ef-83bd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蒲州","place_name_jianti_auto":"蒲州","start_index":50,"tongjian_id":"b6c844e2-db0e-11ef-9e81-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"宋白曰：絳州，晉都，左傳所謂新田也。後周武成二年，置絳州。龍門，漢皮氏縣也，後魏改爲龍門縣，隋、唐屬蒲州。","note_content_jianti_auto":"宋白曰：绛州，晋都，左传所谓新田也。后周武成二年，置绛州。龙门，汉皮氏县也，后魏改为龙门县，隋、唐属蒲州。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"b6c844d4-db0e-11ef-9258-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"絳州","place_name_jianti_auto":"绛州","place_note":"山西省新绛县","resolved_place_entity_id":776,"start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"b6c844eb-db0e-11ef-b1f9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/二、平阳府（卷四十一）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"调露初，以突厥降部背叛，遣将屯龙门以备之。开元二年，置仓...","context_before":"...击破贼帅毋端儿于龙门。十三年，渊起义师克绛郡，遂至龙门。","source_end_index":311,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"cc4991e4-d4f5-53a9-8d0e-bc2bb0cd35c8","source_start_index":290,"source_text":"唐武德二年，刘武周将宋金刚逼绛州，陷龙门。"},{"context_after":"或曰：美良川在城东北。今柏壁镇有秦王堡，亦以世民而名也]...","context_before":"...柏壁镇。太武帝置东雍州治于此。后周武帝置绛州，初亦治此。","source_end_index":102,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"a8f6310b-8191-5027-b362-a67125ff1c19","source_start_index":59,"source_text":"唐初刘武周及其将宋金刚陷并、浍等州，世民进讨，自龙门渡河，屯柏壁，大破其别将于美良川。"}],"path":"山西方舆纪要/二、平阳府（卷四十一）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"武周據太原，遣宋金剛攻晉州，拔之，虜右驍衞大將軍劉弘基，弘基逃歸。金剛進逼絳州，陷龍門。","content_fanyi":"刘武周占据太原，派宋金刚进攻晋州，攻克晋州城，擒获唐右骁卫大将军刘弘基，刘弘基逃回唐朝。宋金刚进逼绛州，攻陷龙门县。","content_jianti_auto":"武周据太原，遣宋金刚攻晋州，拔之，虏右骁衞大将军刘弘基，弘基逃归。金刚进逼绛州，陷龙门。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":18063,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百八十七 (唐紀三) / 高祖神堯大聖光孝皇帝上之下 / 武德二年 / 第 97 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":96,"tongjian_id":"b6c844d2-db0e-11ef-a423-a0d3651f611f","year_int":619},"tongjian_id":"b6c844d2-db0e-11ef-a423-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":2},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"絳州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"宋白","people_name_jianti_auto":"宋白","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"b6e5210c-db0e-11ef-9649-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"舜","people_name_jianti_auto":"舜","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"b6e5210d-db0e-11ef-b206-a0d3651f611f"}],"E